rvices for ICT and mobile solutions providers and enterprises. The SAT segment offers a broad spectrum of satellite-based network solutions, such as managed network, high speed internet, value-added broadband applications, and satellite IP virtual private network for the commercial sector and general public. The company provides outsourcing, consultation, e-procurement, and related services; trades in electronic and telecommunication equipment; develops, promotes, and operates general cargo terminal operating system for general cargo terminals; digital procurement; railway system, engineering, and related services; network engineering services; communication solutions; computer hardware, software, and related services; and deals in telecommunications and computer network consultancy services. It also deals with data processing equipment and computer systems; and offers software development, multimedia, IT, and other related services, as well as infrastructure for hosting and data processing services. Privasia Technology Berhad was incorporated in 2008 and is headquartered in Petaling Jaya, Malaysia.","zh":"Privasia Technology Berhad 是一家投资控股公司，成立于2008年，总部位于马来西亚八打灵再也，在马来西亚提供信息技术（IT）、信息与通信技术（ICT）及卫星网络服务（SAT）。","lines":["IT业务：提供IT基础设施外包、咨询、系统集成和采购管理服务。","ICT业务：为ICT和移动解决方案提供商及企业提供无线宽带基础设施、移动与无线通信咨询及系统开发服务。","SAT业务：为商业部门和公众提供卫星网络解决方案，包括托管网络、高速互联网、增值宽带应用和卫星IP虚拟专用网。","其他服务：提供外包、咨询、电子采购、电子与电信设备贸易、通用货运码头操作系统开发与运营、数字采购、铁路系统工程、网络工程、通信解决方案、计算机硬件软件及相关服务。"],"lines_en":["IT: Offers IT infrastructure outsourcing, consultancy, systems integration, and procurement management services.","ICT: Provides wireless broadband infrastructure, mobile and wireless communications consultancy, and systems development for ICT and mobile solutions providers and enterprises.","SAT: Offers satellite-based network solutions such as managed network, high-speed internet, value-added broadband applications, and satellite IP VPN for the commercial sector and general public.","Other services: Provides outsourcing, consultation, e-procurement, trading of electronic and telecommunication equipment, development and operation of general cargo terminal operating system, digital procurement, railway system engineering, network engineering, communication solutions, and computer hardware/software services."]}}